  "limitations": [
    "One blind collection on one wall; the millimetre figures are a single sample, not a distribution, so no threshold is frozen.",
    "Pixels outside the frozen coverage_region are not required by the acceptance gate; their planned-SCAN and safe-pose classifications are explanatory, not additional pass criteria.",
    "The planned-SCAN footprint is the continuous geometric sweep of the frozen task, not proof that every planned point produced a stored image; coverage_count.tif remains the authority for actual capture.",
    "The safe-pose envelope proves geometric existence of a base_link centre in the frozen motion_region at an allowed scan-axis heading; it does not claim the frozen plan visited that pose.",
    "Absolute values from before commit 3f422f5 are not comparable because the photographed surface stood 1.25 mm proud of the drive plane.",
    "One horizontal frame carries no accepted match edge because SIFT finds no keypoints on it; its pose comes from odometry, with a measured 0.022 mm effect on the nearest anchor."
  ],
